= Paul Faure

Paul Faure has been the Secretary-General of the SFIO since 1920. He is a center Marxist follower of Jules Guesde who has opposed SFIO participation in bourgeois-led governments. He is also a committed pacifist and anti-militarist, and opposes confrontation with Hitler and Mussolini.


